    <briefdescription>
<para>Map pseudo instructions that imply an &apos;S&apos; bit onto real opcodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Whether the instruction is encoded with an &apos;S&apos; bit is determined by the optional CPSR def operand.</para>
<para>This will go away once we can teach tblgen how to set the optional CPSR def operand itself. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
